key Down; wait 0.15; key Down; wait 0.15; key Down; wait 0.15
key b; wait 0.3                    # an escape capsule
key Down; wait 0.15; key Down; wait 0.15; key Down; wait 0.15; key Down; wait 0.15
key b; wait 0.3                    # a galactic hyperdrive
